			</tr>
						<tr>
				<td width="30%" class="body" valign="top">
					<b><div class="smallbody"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/user/view_user.php?id=2779">Scandaltrik</a></div></b>
					<div class="xsmall">10/20/2001 - 11:56 PM PST</div>
					<hr width="75%" align="left">
					<div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2184">Scandaltrik Trikaria</a></div><div class="xsmall"><a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=2185">Scandalthef</a></div>					
